UPDATE companies SET description='South Electronics was established in 2012 in Dothan, Alabama. The company operates an 8,000-square-foot facility at the intersection of Technology Drive and Westgate Parkway. It functions as a franchised distributor of electronic components and a sourcing provider for semiconductors.

The company maintains factory-authorized product lines from non-competing manufacturers, offering components such as connectors, sensor cables, battery products, switches, hardware, and magnetics. Its quality management system is certified to AS9120B, and it participates in the GIDEP program and holds DLA registrations. A team of industry veterans, software developers, logistics specialists, and account managers supports sourcing depth and responsive account management.

South Electronics serves customers in automotive, telecommunications, medical, high-technology, and industrial automation sectors. Its franchised lines cover components such as automotive relays, telecom interfaces, and industrial automation parts, supporting semiconductor-driven supply chains.

The company emphasizes combining franchised lines, sourcing depth, and responsive account management to reduce friction in modern supply chains. It selects non-competitive franchise manufacturers to avoid channel conflict and expands factory-direct options based on customer demand, aiming to grow capacity and technical support as customer needs evolve.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9120B','GIDEP','DLA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Franchised electronic component distribution", "Semiconductor sourcing", "Factory-authorized product line management", "Quality management per AS9120B", "GIDEP program participation", "DLA compliance", "Supply chain management", "Account management", "Inventory management"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Telecommunications", "Medical", "High Technology", "Industrial Automation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Factory-authorized product lines from non-competing manufacturers", "AS9120B-certified quality management system", "GIDEP participation and DLA registrations", "Responsive account management with industry veterans and software developers", "Sourcing depth for semiconductor-driven supply chains"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2012 -> db", "Headquarters Dothan, Alabama -> db", "8,000 sq ft facility -> /", "Franchised distributor of electronic components -> /", "AS9120B quality management system -> /quality", "GIDEP participation -> /quality", "DLA registrations -> /quality", "Industries served: automotive, telecom, medical, high tech, industrial automation -> db", "Team includes industry veterans, software developers, logistics specialists, account managers -> /", "Factory-authorized product lines from non-competing manufacturers -> /about-us", "Non-competitive franchise manufacturers -> /about-us", "Expands factory-direct options based on customer demand -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Authorized since 