UPDATE companies SET description='Southeast SolarPros is based in Irmo, South Carolina. Founded in 2009 by Tommy Wood, a mechanical engineer with over 17 years of experience installing solar panels and solar thermal collectors, the company is owner-operated with Wood serving as lead engineer, sales, and service manager.

The firm specializes in designing, installing, and commissioning solar photovoltaic panels, solar thermal collectors, and battery energy storage systems for residential and commercial customers. All designs are created by Wood, who personally inspects and commissions each installation.

Southeast SolarPros serves homeowners and businesses seeking to reduce energy costs and carbon footprints through solar energy systems and battery storage. Its customer base includes residential clients looking for grid resiliency and commercial clients pursuing sustainable energy solutions, with a focus on integrated solar-plus-storage installations.

