UPDATE companies SET description='Southeastern Architectural Woodworks, Inc. was founded in 1978 in Brandon, Mississippi. The company operates from its facility on Shiloh Road and serves clients throughout the southeastern United States.

The firm provides a full-service offering for architectural millwork, taking projects from initial design through fabrication, finishing, and installation. Its capabilities include custom millwork production, wood fabrication, finishing services, and on-site installation performed by dedicated crews who are familiar with each project from start to finish.

Southeastern works primarily with general contractors and construction professionals on commercial projects across the Southeast. The company holds contractor licenses in both Mississippi and Louisiana, allowing it to operate across state lines for a variety of project types. Past projects have spanned the southeastern region, though specific sectors are not publicly detailed.

