otype services -> /", "Supplier consultation for component selection and lifecycle -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Southern Interconnect is an electronic manufacturing service company located in Houston, Texas. We provide custom cable assemblies and fully integrated systems manufactured and delivered to our customer''s specifications.", "founded_year": "1995", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='southern-interconnect' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Southland Steel Fabricators, Inc. was founded in 1986 in Greensburg, Louisiana. The company is owned and operated by the Lombardo family, built on a philosophy of hard work and ethical business practices. It has grown to become one of the largest steel fabricators in the region.

The firm provides a full spectrum of steel fabrication services, including 3D modeling (using SDS/2), engineering, structural and miscellaneous steel fabrication, in-house detailing, project management, and quality assurance. Its 300,000-square-foot fabrication facility houses CNC technology, while a separate 20,000-square-foot coating plant handles fireproofing, galvanizing, and complex industrial coatings. A workforce of more than 200 professionals supports high-volume production capabilities.

Southland Steel serves customers in the steel fabrication industry, with projects ranging from 1,000 to 24,000 tons and values up to $120 million.

