UPDATE companies SET description='Specialty Plastics & Fabrication, Inc. (SPF) operates from Boise, Idaho, where it has served the Treasure Valley for more than three decades as a family‑owned and operated business. The company describes itself as the region’s oldest and largest stocking distributor of industrial process piping components and a custom plastic fabrication shop.

SPF manufactures and distributes fluid processing and handling equipment, offering custom fabrication, CNC machining, and distribution of valves, pumps, tanks, plastic sheets, and pipe. The facility runs three MultiCam CNC router tables (4’×8’, 5’×10’, 6’×10’), a HAAS ST10 CNC lathe, and a HAAS VF3 machining center with a fourth axis, supporting both automated and manual machining. The shop specializes in low‑volume, non‑traditional jobs while also accommodating high‑volume traditional production runs.

Customers span semiconductor, solar, water and wastewater treatment, biomedical, hospital and laboratory, mining, food processing, and aerospace sectors. SPF provides tailored solutions for projects of all sizes, from specialized components to complete piping systems.

The company emphasizes a quality program certified to ISO 9001:2015, competitive pricing, and a mission built on long‑term customer and vendor relationships. Its differentiators include deep stock of high‑purity and industrial plastic piping, in‑house fabrication capacity, and a commitment to delivering products that meet exacting industry standards.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic fabrication", "CNC routing (MultiCam 4\u2019\u00d78\u2019, 5\u2019\u00d710\u2019, 6\u2019\u00d710\u2019 tables)", "CNC turning (HAAS ST10 lathe)", "CNC milling (HAAS VF3 with 4th axis)", "Manual machining", "Fluid processing equipment distribution", "Plastic sheet and pipe distribution", "Quality control per ISO 9001:2015"], "industries": ["Semiconductor", "Solar", "Water treatment", "Wastewater treatment", "Biomedical", "Hospital", "Laboratory", "Mining", "Food processing", "Aerospace"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["MultiCam 4''x8'' CNC Router Table", "MultiCam 5''x10'' CNC Router Table", "MultiCam 6''x10'' CNC Router Table", "HAAS ST10 CNC Lathe", "HAAS VF3 CNC Machine Center with 4th axis"], "volume": "Low\u2011volume non\u2011traditional to high\u2011volume traditional production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Treasure Valley\u2019s oldest and largest stocking distributor of industrial process piping components and custom plastic fabrication", "Family\u2011owned and operated for over 30 years", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "Specializes in low\u2011volume non\u2011traditional jobs and high\u2011volume traditional runs", "Stocks valves, pumps, tanks, plastic sheets and pipe for immediate distribution"], "facts_used": ["Location: Boise, Idaho -> db", "Family-owned and operated for more than 30 years -> /about-us", "Manufacturer and distributor of fluid processing and handling equipment -> /", "Custom fabrication, CNC machining, distribution -> /", "Equipment: MultiCam CNC routers (3 sizes), HAAS ST10 lathe, HAAS VF3 machining center -> / (products list)", "Industries: semiconductor, solar, water, wastewater, biomedical, hospital, lab, mining, food processing, aerospace -> / and /about-us", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /about-us", "Specializes in low-volume non-traditional jobs and high-volume traditional runs -> /", "Stocks valves, pumps, tanks, plastic sheets and pipes -> /", "Treasure Valley''s oldest and largest stocking distributor -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "At SPF, we specialize in the manufacturing and distribution of fluid processing and handling equipment.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='specialty-plastics-fab-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Spice World Inc was founded in 1949 in Orlando, Florida, by Andy "Pops" Caneza, who wanted to make fresh garlic flavor available year‑round. The company began with a focus on sourcing the freshest garlic and has maintained that commitment for over 75 years.

Today Spice World processes and packages a range of fresh‑flavor products including peeled and ready‑to‑use garlic, squeezable ginger, minced and chopped onion (sold as Easy Onion), fresh shallots, seasoning blends, and pesto. The operation follows a "follow the sun" sourcing model to secure consistent quality and availability, and it packages its output in convenient jars and squeezable bottles for both retail and food‑service channels.

The brand serves home cooks, professional chefs, and institutional partners; its community of chefs contributes recipes, and it holds a promotional partnership with the Orlando City and Orlando Pride soccer teams to develop co‑branded recipes.

The founder''s original goal — sharing flavor without seasonal limits — still drives the company''s emphasis on convenience, quality, and innovation, summed up in its "Flavor Without Boundaries" philosophy.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Garlic peeling and processing", "Ginger processing and packaging", "Onion mincing and chopping", "Shallot processing", "Seasoning blend formulation", "Pesto production", "Organic produce processing", "Packaging in jars and squeezable bottles"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Garlic", "Ginger", "Onion", "Shallots", "Organic produce"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Sources produce by following the sun for year\u2011round consistency", "Offers ready\u2011to\u2011use garlic, ginger, onion, and shallots in squeezable bottles and jars", "Provides organic garlic and produce options", "Formulates ready\u2011made seasoning blends and pesto", "Partners with professional sports teams (Orlando City, Orlando Pride) for recipe development"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1949 -> db", "Headquarters Orlando, Florida -> db", "Founder Andy ''Pops'' Caneza -> db", "Products: garlic, ginger, Easy Onion, shallots, seasoning blends, pesto -> /", "Sourcing by following the sun for consistency -> /", "Partnership with Orlando City and Orlando Pride -> /", "Packaging in jars and squeezable bottles -> /", "Organic product line -> /", "Seasoning blends -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We''ve grown from our garlic roots into a category leader that is passionate about providing a variety of innovative products, from peeled, ready-to-use, and organic garlic to fresh shallots, ready-to-use and squeezable ginger, Seasoning Blends, and new Spice World Easy Onion", "founded_year": "1949", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, update