UPDATE companies SET description='Steven Engineering, headquartered in Corona, California, was founded in 1975. The company operates as a distributor and contract manufacturer of industrial controls and components.

The company distributes and custom manufactures switchgear — including arc-resistant, generator control, high-current, low-voltage, and power distribution models — for industrial, commercial, mechanical, marine, and oil-and-gas applications. Its contract manufacturing services span custom design, product assembly, engraving, and kit assembly, supported by a workforce of 100 to 199 employees.

