UPDATE companies SET description='Stickley Furniture operates a retail showroom in Brookfield, Connecticut. The Stickley Museum, founded in 2007, explores the heritage of the Stickley brand, which has been recognized as America’s foremost fine furniture maker. The Brookfield location serves as a physical storefront for the brand, offering a curated selection of furniture and design services.

The showroom sells a range of residential furniture including dressers, beds, tables, desks, bookcases, and the exclusive Fulton Lane collection, as well as Stressless recliners. Services include complimentary design consultations for made-to-order pieces or whole-home projects, white-glove delivery with assembly and placement, warranty support, financing options, and care guides for hardwood, leather, fabric, stone, and hardware. The facility’s size and staff count are not disclosed.

Customers include homeowners, interior designers, and anyone furnishing living rooms, dining rooms, bedrooms, or home offices. The store carries styles from traditional to contemporary, with budget-friendly options alongside premium lines. The showroom also hosts promotional events such as the Multi-Million-Dollar Remodel Event with discounts on Stressless furniture.

Stickley emphasizes its ''Made in America'' craftsmanship and the quality and integrity of its workmanship. The Brookfield showroom promotes a no-pressure shopping experience with a well-organized layout and a dedicated Sleep Studio. The company’s differentiators include complimentary design services, white-glove delivery, and a focus on American-made materials such as premium hardwoods, stone tops, and upholstery fabrics.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Retail furniture sales", "Interior design consultation", "White-glove delivery and assembly", "Warranty service", "Financing options", "Product care guidance"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home furnishings", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Hardwoods", "Stone", "Hardware", "Upholstery fabrics", "Leather", "Fabric"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Complimentary design services for custom and whole-home projects", "White-glove delivery with in-home assembly and placement", "Made-in-America craftsmanship using premium hardwoods and fabrics", "No-pressure showroom experience with dedicated Sleep Studio", "Warranty coverage and financing options"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2007 (museum) -> db", "Location Brookfield, CT -> /", "Showroom address 270 Federal Rd -> /", "Phone  -> /", "Hours Mon-Tue 10-6, Wed closed, Thu-Sat 10-6, Sun 12-5 -> /", "Complimentary design services -> /", "White glove delivery -> /", "Warranty coverage -> /", "Financing options -> /", "Care instructions for hardwood, leather, fabric, stone, hardware -> /", "Products: dressers, beds, tables, desks, bookcases -> products array", "Stressless furniture -> /", "Fulton Lane collection -> /", "Made in America -> /", "No-pressure welcome desk -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Brookfield, CT Get Directions Contact Us 270 Federal Rd Brookfield, CT US 06804", "founded_year": "2007", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "m