UPDATE companies SET description='Stitt Solar, based in Rogers, Arkansas, has been installing solar energy systems since 1978. The company began as a solar installer and has grown to serve residential and commercial customers across Northwest Arkansas and parts of Missouri.

The company provides end-to-end solar services including consultation and design, permitting, installation, and activation. It also offers battery storage solutions for off-grid homes, as well as inspection, repair, inverter installation, critter guard, and removal/reinstallation for roof replacement. Stitt Solar handles all city permits and utility paperwork, coordinating permission to operate.

Stitt Solar serves homeowners, businesses, and off-grid property owners in Arkansas cities such as Fayetteville, Bentonville, Rogers, and Springdale, and in Missouri communities including Branson and Nixa. Its customer base spans residential, commercial, and off-grid sectors.

The company distinguishes itself through an education-first approach, avoiding high-pressure sales and emphasizing clear, honest information. With over 45 years of experience, Stitt Solar positions itself as a local installer that helps clients understand the financial and environmental benefits of solar.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar PV system design and consultation", "Permitting and utility interconnection", "Residential solar installation", "Commercial solar installation", "Battery storage system installation", "Off-grid solar system design", "Solar system inspection and repair", "Inverter installation and replacement", "Critter guard installation", "Solar panel removal and reinstallation for roof replacement"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Battery storage", "Off-grid solar"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Education-first approach with no high-pressure sales", "45+ years of solar installation experience since 1978", "In-house energy consultants handle design and permitting", "Expertise in off-grid and battery storage systems", "Service and repair for existing solar installations"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1978 -> db", "Headquarters in Rogers, Arkansas -> db", "Installs solar energy systems since 1978 -> /", "Offers residential, commercial, and battery storage installation -> /", "Provides consultation, design, permitting, installation, and activation -> /", "Offers solar panel inspection, repair, inverter installation, critter guard, removal/reinstall -> /", "Serves cities in Arkansas and Missouri -> /", "Education-first approach, no high-pressure sales -> /", "In-house Energy Consultants -> /", "Handles permitting and utility paperwork -> /", "Specializes in off-grid home design and battery storage -> /", "45+ years of experience -> /", "Award-winning solar company -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_p