UPDATE companies SET description='The company provides turn-key fabrication services including structural welding (AWS D1.1 certified in FCAW and GMAW), pipe welding (certified to ASME Section IX, B31.3, and API 1104 in SMAW, GMAW, and GTAW), pipe fitting, construction of steel or wood insulated buildings, assembly with hydrostatic and pneumatic testing per B31.3, electrical wiring by master and journeyman electricians, and a 7,700-square-foot climate-controlled paint and blast facility with 36-by-22-by-18-foot booths staffed by a NACE CIP Level 1 inspector. Its quality program is based on ISO 9001 and includes certified weld inspectors, non-destructive testing, and factory acceptance testing. Lean manufacturing principles such as 5S, waste elimination, and level-loaded production have reportedly increased capacity by 66 percent while cutting waste 45 percent and costs 28 percent.

Sund Manufacturing primarily serves the oil and gas industry, supplying engineered equipment and structures built to withstand harsh North Dakota climates. Its customer base includes operators and contractors requiring custom or repeatable fabricated assemblies, insulated enclosures, and fully wired, plug-and-play modules for field deployment.

The company emphasizes its family-ownership heritage as a differentiator, stating that its reputation drives a commitment to exceed customer expectations.', certifications=ARRAY['ASME','AWS D1.1','ASME Section IX','ASME B31.3','API 1104','NACE CIP Level 1','ISO 9001-based quality management system','Certified Weld Inspectors (CWI and CAWI)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural welding (GMAW, FCAW, AWS D1.1 certified)", "Pipe welding (SMAW, GMAW, GTAW, ASME Section IX, B31.3, API 1104 certified)", "Pipe fitting", "Construction of steel or wood insulated buildings", "Assembly (threaded and flanged connections, hydrostatic and pneumatic testing per B31.3)", "Electrical wiring (master and journeyman electricians)", "Paint and blast coatings (7,700 sq ft facility, 36x22x18 ft booths, NACE CIP Level 1 inspection)", "Quality management (ISO 9001 based, receiving/in-process/final inspection, quality planning, non-destructive testing, factory acceptance testing, certified weld inspectors CWI/CAWI)", "Lean manufacturing (5S, waste elimination, level loaded production, continuous improvement)"], "industries": ["Oil and gas", "Construction"], "materials": ["Steel", "Wood", "Insulation"], "equipment": ["7,700 sq ft paint and blast facility with 36x22x18 ft booths"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fourth-generation family-owned business with 80-year history", "Lean manufacturing adoption (5S, waste elimination, level-loaded production) yielding 66% capacity increase", "7,700 sq ft climate-controlled paint and blast facility with NACE CIP Level 1 inspection", "AWS D1.1 and ASME Section IX/B31.3/API 1104 certified welding processes", "In-house master and journeyman electricians for plug-and-play module wiring"], "facts_used": ["Newburg, North Dakota -> db", "Fourth-generation family-owned business, 80 years and still going strong -> /", "Turn-key services: structural welding, pipe welding, pipe fitting, construction, electrical -> /", "St