UPDATE companies SET description='The business built a local reputation for technical expertise and quality workmanship before expanding its reach nationally. Today the company is headquartered in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, and operates across 13 states.

The firm provides turnkey solar energy services for residential and commercial customers, including custom system design, engineering, panel installation, battery storage integration, microinverter deployment, and roofing coordination. It also offers engineering and installation support to other solar companies. To date, Suntria has completed more than 20,000 installations, backed by a 30-year warranty that covers 100 percent of parts, labor, removal, and reinstallation.

Primary customers are homeowners seeking energy independence, as well as solar developers and EPCs that subcontract engineering and installation work. The company has served "some of the most recognized names in solar" while maintaining a direct-to-consumer channel that helps households navigate federal tax credits, local incentives, and financing.

Suntria emphasizes a customer-centric mission to "win the happiness of our customers through energy independence." Differentiators cited by the company include U.S.-manufactured solar modules and equipment, financing programs with near-instant credit decisions, and a seamless process from design through warranty service, guided by values of integrity, innovation, and responsible growth.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation", "Solar system design", "Engineering services for solar companies", "Warranty service (30-year)", "Financing facilitation", "Solar battery installation", "Microinverter installation", "Roofing services (solar + roofing)", "Federal tax credit navigation", "Local incentive identification", "Net metering coordination", "Custom PV system design"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Solar engineering services", "Renewable energy"], "materials": ["Solar panels", "Solar batteries", "Microinverters", "Inverters", "Mounting hardware"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["30-year warranty covering parts, labor, removal, and reinstallation", "Solar modules and equipment manufactured in the USA", "Financing programs with near-instant credit decisions", "Engineering and installation services for nationally recognized solar companies", "Customer-focused process from design through warranty service"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2004 in Phoenix, Arizona as Premier Solar Solutions -> /about-us", "Born from a family of electrical contractors -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma -> db", "Over 20,000 customers across 13 states -> /", "30-year warranty covering 100% parts, labor, removal, reinstallation -> /", "Solar modules and equipment Made in America -> /", "Financing programs with near-instant credit decisions -> /", "Engineering and installation services for recognized solar companies -> /about-us", "Services: solar panel installa