y owned and operated metal fabrication business in Gresham Oregon, providing for local businesses and customers throughout the Pacific Northwest.", "founded_year": "2016", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='superior-metal-fab-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Superior Metalcraft was founded in 2008 in Lansing, Illinois, and operates a fully-equipped fabrication facility in the Chicago area.

The company provides custom metal fabrication and machining services, working with stainless steel, aluminum, and carbon steel. Its capabilities include welding, coating, CNC machining, and production of stair systems, handrails, food processing equipment, platforms, enclosures, ventilation components, hoods, machine guards, and more. Over 18 years in business, it has processed more than 18,000 tons of steel and used 5.1 million feet of welding wire. Superior Metalcraft also offers emergency breakdown repair and high-volume consumable parts production.

Customers include facilities requiring OSHA-compliant structures, custom stair and railing systems, and specialized equipment for production environments.

