UPDATE companies SET description='TVS Manufacturing Specialists, Inc. is a veteran-owned company based in Lexington, South Carolina. The firm has been in operation for 45 years, though its exact founding year is not publicly disclosed. It operates as a veteran-owned and operated business, with ownership held by military veterans.

The company runs two distinct divisions. One focuses on the design and manufacture of magnetic components, including air coils, toroids, high-voltage transformers, and springs. The other produces battery cables and wiring assemblies for applications such as golf carts, marine vessels, and material-handling equipment like forklifts. TVS handles pre-production planning, first-piece inspection and test, in-process audits, and final audit and test, emphasizing on-time delivery.

Its customer base spans the golf cart, marine, and material-handling industries, with magnetic components also serving a broader range of industrial sectors.

