e design and manufacturing of high-quality magnetic components... The other division is dedicated to the production of durable and efficient battery cables...", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Veteran-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='tvs-manufacturing-specialist-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='T.Y. Fine Furniture was founded in 2004 in Columbus, Ohio, by Tarik Yousef, a former Honda engineer who applied his precision background to furniture design. The company began with a focus on combining traditional joinery techniques with modern engineering principles.

The workshop produces solid-wood furniture for bedrooms, dining rooms, living rooms, and home offices, using four Ohio hardwoods — cherry, black walnut, white oak, and hard maple. Each piece is built to order using mortise-and-tenon, dovetail, and floating-tenon joinery reinforced with stainless steel dowels, with boards hand-selected for grain and color. Finishing is done by hand with a zero-VOC, food-grade organic oil developed in collaboration with an Ohio State microbiologist. The company operates its own shop within a 200-mile radius of Columbus and maintains two retail showrooms in the Clintonville and Grandview Heights neighborhoods.

The primary customer base is residential buyers seeking heirloom-quality furniture, though the showrooms also carry complementary lines from Stressless, American Leather, Fjords, and Naturepedic.

The company differentiates itself through a lifetime structural guarantee, a finish safe enough for nursery use, and a program that plants two trees for every order placed.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mortise and tenon joinery", "Dovetail joinery", "Floating tenon joinery", "Stainless steel dowel reinforcement", "Hand-selected board matching", "Zero-VOC organic oil finishing", "Custom dimension manufacturing", "White glove delivery and assembly", "Curbside residential delivery", "Local material sourcing (within 200 miles)", "Tree planting program (two trees per order)"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home office furniture", "Bedroom furniture", "Dining furniture", "Living room furniture", "Custom woodworking"], "materials": ["Cherry", "Black Walnut", "White Oak", "Hard Maple", "Stainless steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lifetime structural guarantee on every piece", "Zero-VOC food-grade organic finish", "Made to order with custom dimensions", "Mortise-and-tenon joinery reinforced with stainless steel dowels", "Two trees planted with every order"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2004 -> db", "Founder Tarik Yousef -> db", "Engineering background from Honda -> db", "Headquarters in Columbus, Ohio -> db", "Mortise and tenon joinery with stainless steel dowels -> /", "Zero-VOC food-grade organic finish -> /", "Lifetime structural guarantee -> /", "Two retail stores in Clintonville and Grandview Heights -> /", "Four Ohio hardwoods: Cherry, Black Walnut, White Oak, Hard Maple -> /", "Made to order with custom dimensions -> /", "Local sourcing within 200 miles -> /", "Two trees planted per order -> /", "Free shipping and white glove delivery -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Built by hand in our own shop, guaranteed for life, and sold in our two Columbus furniture stores.", "founded_year": "2004", "employee_count": "", "cage_code"